{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2a1b2de6d3279c083be735d03329dc95496d040039e9af78571cd4b5744bb660", "ja": "（莉緒の初公演まで、あと少し……。\n本番まで、しっかりプロデュースしていかないとな）", "zh": "（莉绪的首次公演就快到了……\n在正式演出前要好好培育她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "70392ebbe2bf5c2233b165088e5b5e30c1884a3872b6642b97b0b9e1ddc94413", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くん？\nやだ、もうこんな時間だったのね！", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}？\n讨厌，原来这么晚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "709e11bf0f072a06a03064ff4cb8dd6910ad55c71245252b6d201a209e7a1501", "ja": "私ったら、レッスンに夢中になっちゃってたみたい。\nやーね、ウフフ♪", "zh": "我也真是的，似乎完全投入在练习之中了。\n好呆喔，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e688322f65862669ef2e0c4427632c9cb3813dea5129543444def7f22d910611", "ja": "レッスンお疲れさま、莉緒。\nその様子だと、順調そうだな。", "zh": "练习辛苦了，莉绪。\n看样子相当顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "0e2680463dda3cd967eddc1593863d96b9adc593f16603489bf06795c6c3c2b1", "ja": "ええ、順調よ♪\n今ね、すっごくいい感じなの。", "zh": "是啊，非常顺利♪\n我现在感觉很棒哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "e79cc8a57f8b511bf22197a5203f74cb9a48d16f5d640102b418a66fbff37243", "ja": "頭と体の動きが、ちゃんと一致していて。\n脂が乗ってる……っていうのかしら？", "zh": "脑袋和身体相当协调。\n得心应手……这样说没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "c73a573789485f18274716ca364c341eed570e824806d53e9b560d81a1dec133", "ja": "私、趣味でヨガをやってるんだけどね？\nこれって、すご～くいい状態なのよ！", "zh": "我跟你说，我平时兴趣是做瑜伽，\n所以知道自己现在的状态非常～棒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b0add0bb01e8f7c1055f7d57b05f995bbdeaa6f694a8804a205f538b40a80be2", "ja": "そうか。\nあんまり緊張してないみたいで、ホッとしたよ。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n看你似乎不怎么紧张，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "4d5cc8ee1f69e27676453144711351e34769be43586469d3085d64c4146f6514", "ja": "ウフッ、ガッカリしちゃった？\nちょっとくらい、甘えればよかったかしら？　なんて♪", "zh": "呵呵，你失望了吧？\n还是你希望我跟你撒娇一下？开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7ba631609259f78c953aede5c489473fa13b9905376a6e7cd8aca678e1584535", "ja": "（社会人だけあって、やっぱり落ち着いてるな。\n宣材写真の時のような心配は、必要なかったか）", "zh": "（出社会有过历练就是不一样，果然很冷静。\n看来不必像拍宣传照时那么担心了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee101eb2c945285492c4e0bf9d0fd499fa24478ce73956267de65ea374c01658", "ja": "ところで{$P$}くん、\nその手に持ってるもの、何？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}，\n你手上拿的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3cfeb4dc8ffb17bf61a2bf85fb64a5933d27f2bcbe5272f731c1c27928bac493", "ja": "ああ、当日の舞台構成と衣装についての資料だよ。\n後で目を通しておいてくれるか？", "zh": "哦哦，这是公演当天舞台流程和服装的资料。\n待会你可以看一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "432105299f3a71273089e5a876bea8ea5aa61ef33d9c73bdfaabe80d8e18dead", "ja": "いいわよ。……ところでこれって、\n{$P$}くんが考えたの？", "zh": "好哦……话说，{$P$}，\n这些都是你想的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "eb7787975617b52f70d564bf01f3069fbac384e839455df5047795668c1b301e", "ja": "そうだな。実際にどこまでできるかは、\n舞台監督とか、スタッフと相談しながらだけど……。", "zh": "不全都是，实际上能够执行到什么程度，\n还是得再跟舞台导演和工作人员讨论……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "85ab7d252fa29512d58082854149270107f314c0e3c1cf3fac13aae40f94ef08", "ja": "ふぅ～ん……こういうのって、案外すごく細かいのね。\nいろいろ考えられてるんだ……。", "zh": "是喔……想不到这么严谨。\n原来要设想那么多事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aa14390a14bd96f1bec30d524bc1f41db4017031ff4874ea7aa33dcdf799f5d1", "ja": "そうだな。細かく決めておけば、\n当日何かあっても対処できるし……それに。", "zh": "是啊。想得周密点，\n不管当天发生什么状况就都能应付了……而且──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "e504e62ff427d5a42d642dc530a8cb62036fdb38068d1d40963153eb178feb6d", "ja": "それに？", "zh": "而且？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "49e021241940c6a38bf30a9c82a5cb9bd859da7d0e9a9ae10ec0d5c8fd7db624", "ja": "莉緒の初舞台だろ？\nどんなことがあっても、いいものにしたいからな！", "zh": "这是莉绪首次登台不是吗？\n我希望无论遇到什么状况，都要做到尽善尽美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "8af7e8ad152b0e7831ebe6e9d24ce1e56245e200dfb5bc38701cbd47672be351", "ja": "{$P$}くん……。", "zh": "{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "98f389cfec61b8b2b625fa2a7b1a6b8da4988eeb1f89594c5909cf91fb0f27eb", "ja": "まあ、初舞台にトラブルはつきものだから。\n莉緒には、遠慮せず、思いっきりいってほしい。", "zh": "不过，首次上场表演本来就多少会有点状况。\n莉绪，你就不要想太多，尽情表现吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "03d577a707b2c7c8aff803307de0db5b7eebbb881a86f8c21a4c31ca912cec2f", "ja": "もう……やぁね。\nヘンなところで、ズルいんだから。", "zh": "真是的……讨厌。\n你总是在奇怪的时候冒出这么犯规的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "269c0b01fc71a932059d870e80cd144499aaba1a3744f235f82829a99d0f9a4f", "ja": "こんなに、一生懸命応援されたら……\n嬉しくて、泣きそうになっちゃうじゃない……。", "zh": "你这么拚命支持我……\n我都快喜极而泣了啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7f71dce3554bca620794d5eedd7d5d4beb01622c16c4914274388fe0b4ee50a1", "ja": "莉緒？\nごめん、不安にさせるようなこと言っちゃったか？", "zh": "莉绪？\n抱歉，是不是我说的话让你感到不安了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee0663238005eb1c3f1ce4929a4391cfb6cc8e8a3cb1a27c4efaf1eee9a0c5c0", "ja": "ううん、なんでもないの！\n私のためにいろいろ考えてくれて、ありがとう！", "zh": "不是，我没怎样啦！\n谢谢你为我设想这么多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "2a3923be804b8d0003ec4f4c50ba00c8e07a6d211abafd3d4fe53c1d7df56dca", "ja": "{$P$}くん、見ててね！\n私の初公演、絶対に成功させてみせるから！", "zh": "{$P$}，你要看好哦！\n我的首次公演，一定会成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0bac416ed38d70c52c2d3cfd36ea295cc3703ae91948a65173af0f09ddf43da0", "ja": "莉緒……。", "zh": "莉绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "29475097ecc0c9205190f5783ac96955ce55b742fa4a615370e1806858363918", "ja": "でなきゃ、女がすたるってものだわ！\n本番は色気特盛りでいくから、期待してて！", "zh": "不然叫我的脸要往哪里摆！\n正式演出时我会拿出满满性感，敬请期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1027_p", "source_sha256": "20964298e68297d0e147e46caac5783f83228c17a3d2a331eb90d11b27831889", "ja": "えーと……色気は、ほどほどにな？", "zh": "这个嘛……性感成分还是点到为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "eb3ce41ec6b02669c653159bb781cf9945d7a18f6c07b72bedb4bdf3f733b807", "ja": "やだ、{$P$}くんったら。\n照れなくていいのよ？　ウフッ♪", "zh": "唉唷，{$P$}，你也真是的。\n不用害羞啦，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a4e4f1e00e91bc043809855124ec93f44729cb66d8bca906a41d0ee1fe93b31d", "ja": "いや、照れているわけじゃ……。", "zh": "不是，我没有害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "1676f534c48044c2db926d02781f89dc85c7a49d518f15e1815e73d49eaaefd3", "ja": "あ、そうだわ！\n初公演が終わったら、パーっと打ち上げしない？", "zh": "啊，对了！\n首次公演结束之后，要不要去喝一杯庆祝？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "a324321d2d243bad218931bf33388f58c437f4ace23f27e2f01b02ff0f04124a", "ja": "私のステージデビューのお祝いに！\nねぇねぇ、いいでしょ？", "zh": "庆祝我首次登台成功！\n欸欸欸，好不好嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3e2ceb823a570ff878b615d917120f04820668faa44468b035fedc85706a5bdc", "ja": "ああ。\n終わったら、パーッと打ち上げをしよう！", "zh": "好啊。\n结束之后一起开庆功宴喝一杯吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "16bce0b1faac63927f1b240d4ae6a9a278fa04886be5f47ba5a52e87dfeac53f", "ja": "やった、やったぁ♪　楽しみもできたコトだし……\n本番まで、気合い入れていくわよ～！", "zh": "好耶、好耶♪这样就有乐趣能期待了……\n正式表演之前，我要卯尽全力练习～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_046rio_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_003_1034_p", "source_sha256": "0940122ec7615707742923ae03991466f5a7742e78187ed1295c4027f36c76ff", "ja": "（莉緒、気合いが入ったみたいだな。打ち上げのお店は\nちょっと奮発して、いいところを予約しておこう！）", "zh": "（看来莉绪鼓足干劲了。举办庆功宴的餐厅\n就大手笔订一间高级点的吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
